            "review_title": "Review at Nhà An",
            "review_text": "Susan Zoe F\n307 contributions\n0\nWide range of delicious dishes for all\nJun 2026 • Solo\nThis restaurant has it all. Fabulous food, smiling and efficient staff. Live music outside sometimes. There is both outside and inside seating which is comfortable.\nA very varied menu to suit everyone I think. \nThe first night I went for dinner I was seated easily despite being solo. I ordered the 3 pancakes with rice papers. It was accompanied by a huge lettuce, cabbage, banana flower and fresh herbs salad. Cucumber, mango and peanut sate sauce. Phi one of their lovely staff showed me how to eat the dishes. Absolutely delicious and the pancakes had a great crunch to them. Passion Fruit and soda was very refreshing on such a hot evening.\nTonight I ordered chicken with lemongrass and Kaffir lime. Plain rice. \nThe dish was SO full of flavour. \nMango soda was cool and refreshing.\nAll the staff are lovely. My favourite restaurant in the area. 🙂\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nCome early it gets busy very fast.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 23, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
