            "review_text": "J F\n1 contribution\n0\nFine but wouldn't recommend\nFeb 2026 • Family\nPoor service had to call someone over to order. When we did order a number of things were not available. Which could have been communicated before we looked at the menu. The food cames a long time before drinks and one of our meal didn't come till everyone else had finished. They're also running food and drinks between the restaurant and the one next door constantly. Beware additional service charge was 25% of the total bill so not believe the prices. The prices on menu were ok there was nothing to tell you about the service charge. Atmosphere was fine and the food was ok.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 20, 2026",
