            "review_text": "Gloria C\n1 contribution\n0\nWorst Food Poisoning\nJan 2026 • Couples\nAfter eating here, both my husband and I suffered from EXTREME FOOD POISONING. \n\nThis is the worst food poisoning we have ever experienced, requiring us to go to the hospital for uncontrollable vomiting. This was not a little bit of sickness, I am back home now and still feeling the effects one week later. \n\nBefore getting sick, this is the only restaurant we ate in (one large meal on the day we got sick). I was personally extremely careful (no ice or raw food) the whole trip and only going to restaurants with good reviews. I have no idea how this restaurant has so many positive reviews.\nRead more\nWritten January 15, 2026",
